sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Warp SQL server
  C->>S: POST /warp/v1/sessions/{id}/ingests {"table", "mode"}
  S-->>C: 201 {"ingest_id", "state": "open", "parts": []}
  par one connection per part
    C->>S: POST …/ingests/{ingest_id}/parts/0 (Arrow stream)
    S-->>C: 200 {"part": 0, "rows_received"}
  and
    C->>S: POST …/ingests/{ingest_id}/parts/1 (Arrow stream)
    S-->>C: 200 {"part": 1, "rows_received"}
  end
  C->>S: POST …/ingests/{ingest_id}/commit {"part_count": 2}
  alt every part has arrived
    S-->>C: 200 {"rows_ingested"}, all parts in one transaction
  else a part is missing
    S-->>C: 409 ingest_incomplete (still open: upload it, commit again)
  end
